[en.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM]
The Kirin Dream

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM_desc]
We Must March Together Under the Banner of Unity! Only through collective effort and unwavering dedication can we achieve the Kirin Dream.\nAlways be aware of the danger of the Niriks lurking in the shadows, waiting to rise again. But that won’t happen, as long as every proud and hardworking Kirin stands together, united in purpose and spirit, as long as our economic development becomes a beacon lighting the way forward. We will not fail.\nLet us forge a path towards greatness, working tirelessly to make our commune proud and our future bright. Remember, in unity we are weak no more, in hardworking we are Niriks no more.

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM_TOOLTIP]
The §Cnation§!’s §0Nirik Rate Growth§! is further decreased by §G5.0%§! (total decrease is approximately §Y8.0%§!)

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM]
麒麟之梦

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM_desc]
我们必须在团结的旗帜下共同前进！只有通过集体努力和坚定的奉献精神，我们才能实现麒麟之梦。\n时刻警惕潜伏在黑暗中，逆麟的复苏。但只要每一位骄傲而勤劳的麒麟团结一致，共同担负起责任，我们的经济发展就将成为照亮前路的明灯，我们就不会失败。\n让我们共同开创伟大的道路，不懈努力，使我们的社群自豪，我们的未来光明。记住，团结，就不再会显得弱小，勤劳，就不再会出现逆麟。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_KIRIN_DREAM_TOOLTIP]
§C全国§!的§0逆麟率增长速度§! 进一步降低 §G5.0%§!（总降低约为 §Y8.0%§!）

